{
  "_about": [
    "Behaviour profiles for the offline replay provider. These are written fixtures,",
    "not recorded API traffic, and they exist so the scoring pipeline can be run and",
    "checked end to end without an API key. Each profile says how one simulated model",
    "deviates from the golden answer under each prompt version.",
    "",
    "errors: fields the model gets wrong on that case, the same way on every repeat.",
    "unstable: one override per repeat, cycled by repeat index, for run-to-run drift.",
    "omits: fields the model leaves out of its JSON object entirely.",
    "style: surface formatting only. Every style renders the same meaning, so the",
    "scorer's normalization is what makes the styles score equally."
  ],
